OL,3,GNEWSABoy arrested after reports of
OL,4,Astabbing
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice are investigating a reported
OL,7,Fstabbing in Stoke-on-Trent.
OL,9,FStaffordshire Police went to Upper
OL,10,FMarket Square in Hanley at 17:50 BST on
OL,11,FTuesday, after being told teenage boy
OL,12,Fhad been stabbed in a fight involving a
OL,13,Fgroup of young people.
OL,15,FIt said a 17-year-old boy from Stafford
OL,16,Fwas taken to hospital and was later
OL,17,Farrested on suspicion of possession of
OL,18,Fa bladed article in a public place and
OL,19,Faffray.
